  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "According to Boyle's law, $P V=$ constant\n$\\therefore \\log P+\\log V=$ constant\n$\\log P=-\\log V+$ constant\nHence, the plot of $\\log P$ vs $\\log V$ is straight line with negative slope.",
